        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check EC status in Hardware Drivers before first use. Fan control and charge limits require a compatible driver; restart and boot through the configured OpenCore after setup. Automatic fan mode does not allow manual curve editing. Select zones and apply colors in Lighting. Diagnostic logs contain currently read status only, never administrator passwords."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次使用请在“硬件驱动”检查 EC 状态。风扇控制和充电上限需要兼容驱动；配置后请重启并从对应 OpenCore 启动。自动风扇模式不能手动调整曲线。灯光页面可选择区域并应用颜色。诊断日志仅包含当前已读取的状态，不包含管理员密码。"
